%Plain% > *: code sharp strong fill=none ink

SVG, PNG: @file
A: rounded red
LLMs%: soft label=strong
[diff]: label=black fill-color = #DDD font = "Fira Code"
[diff] > (*): code label-color=green
[diff] > %- %: label-color=red
